WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.044
CAST
And... action!

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:03.390
SHANG-CHI
How's it going?

00:00:05.914 --> 00:00:06.828
SHANG-CHI
Get off of me!

00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:09.009
KATY
Does he look like he can fight?

00:00:14.523 --> 00:00:16.623
♪♪

00:00:17.531 --> 00:00:19.737
SIMU LIU
The moment that I was cast for Shang-Chi

00:00:19.787 --> 00:00:22.411
I was like nervous-slash-anxious
-slash-excited.

00:00:22.461 --> 00:00:25.708
Never thought that I would
be Marvel's first Asian superhero.

00:00:27.826 --> 00:00:29.826
KATY
Wow, you're really good.

00:00:31.037 --> 00:00:33.018
SIMU LIU
I showed up for the first day of training

00:00:33.068 --> 00:00:35.642
and I just got my butt kicked.

00:00:35.693 --> 00:00:37.057
Ow! Panic at the disco!

00:00:37.607 --> 00:00:38.965
We explored what his strengths were,

00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:40.709
we also covered all his weaknesses.

00:00:41.717 --> 00:00:42.591
[Laughing]

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.398
The training that he went through

00:00:45.449 --> 00:00:46.982
mirrored the character.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.885
SIMU LIU
The sets were incredible.

00:00:49.935 --> 00:00:51.705
Everything has been carefully designed.

00:00:51.755 --> 00:00:53.387
KATY
No, screw you, I'm not doing this!

00:00:53.837 --> 00:00:54.837
CREW
Fall!

00:00:56.217 --> 00:00:57.744
SIMU LIU
[Laughing]

00:00:57.795 --> 00:01:00.435
I'm working with some
of the best in the business.

00:01:01.396 --> 00:01:03.081
MICHELLE YEOH
I've never seen a superhero

00:01:03.131 --> 00:01:04.940
that looks something like me.

00:01:05.178 --> 00:01:06.423
AWKWAFINA
Movies like this allows kids

00:01:06.473 --> 00:01:07.776
to feel the possibilities.

00:01:09.254 --> 00:01:10.735
SIMU LIU
It was such a profound moment

00:01:10.785 --> 00:01:13.902
for me as fan,
as an actor, as an Asian person.

00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:16.418
♪♪

